;;; the sum and the integral are interchanged, and (76)
;;;     int_gamma phi(z)/(z - u) dz = sum_k (u - xi)^k int_gamma phi(z)/(z - xi)^(k+1) dz.
;;; Remark 3.34 names the coefficients (77); Theorem 3.35 feeds the integral
;;; formula of a triangle (Prop 3.32 / 3.41) into it; 3.7 (Prop 3.47, Cor 3.48)
;;; bounds the coefficients by M r^-n.
